SY_TALK("huS7qwo1BFs",[[5,["I am very happy to see so many people here","to know about Sahaja Yoga in all its details."]],[17,["But in this short time, what can you be told?"]],[24,["That firstly you got your realization, you","felt the cool breeze all right, and that it"]],[36,["was an experience."]],[39,["But beyond this experience you have to settle","down."]],[44,["It is very, very important that you must have","desire to settle down."]],[54,["You don’t know the importance of your personality."]],[60,["You are the one who’ll save this world."]],[68,["Because the salvation of the whole world is","not possible with Myself; and you people who"]],[82,["will be really developed, it will be such","a force."]],[91,["I told about England yesterday, another thing","is that England is the heart of the universe,"]],[101,["I think."]],[102,["Everything circulates from here, whatever","happens small or big, it circulates."]],[110,["It is not that only England has many newspapers","or television centers but somehow it circulates"]],[122,["everywhere."]],[124,["I used to think only in India, it’s not","so."]],[127,["I’ve seen everywhere, every country, there's","news about England."]],[135,["Even in America, even in South America, I","was surprised how people are worried about"]],[142,["England so much that they want to know what’s","happening in England."]],[148,["My own experience is this, that they get so","upset with the things that upset your country,"]],[159,["not only that but anything that happens of","a very small importance is noted down and"]],[173,["they always tell Me, “Mother, we have seen","in the newspaper, we have seen in the television.”"]],[179,["America is such a vast country and also the","newspapers are vast, and their television"]],[187,["is impossible to gauge anything out of it."]],[193,["Horrible."]],[194,["What they say also language wise, we are not","so good for American language."]],[199,["So, they’re little exclusive people, I think","their idea is to be exclusive."]],[206,["For example, if they produce anything electrical,","it has to have 110 watt, while normally people"]],[219,["have 220, so nobody can buy their electrical","productions."]],[222,["Now they have started a small production of","that."]],[229,["They try to be exclusive, while I think England","is not like that, it’s not exclusive, it’s"]],[235,["not only keeping all its things to itself."]],[236,["This is something, a very great quality that","England has."]],[249,["It has many other qualities, as I told you","yesterday, there has to be self-esteem."]],[255,["One quality is that they never go to extremes."]],[261,["I mean we had some hippies, we had little","bit of this and that, but they don’t go"]],[268,["to extremes."]],[269,["But in America or any other country, if something","starts it really blasts the whole atmosphere."]],[279,["This balancing in England is something really","very surprising."]],[291,["Also they are disciplined people, they have","their own discipline, and with their discipline,"]],[297,["they…"]],[298,["like people who are disciplined, who are very","much in time, properly dressed for the occasion"]],[309,["and I’m not trying to just praise you, but","this is My observation."]],[315,["And in this observation I find, once Sahaja","Yoga settles down in England, it will spread"]],[321,["all over the world."]],[323,["Then I don’t have to run about in every","country."]],[326,["That’s very important, that it should settle","down here, that is you should all understand"]],[334,["the importance of Sahaja Yoga."]],[339,["When I first came to London, My husband had","a job and I started My work with seven people,"]],[350,["out of them I think five were hippies."]],[355,["But immediately they got rid of their drugs,","alcohols and all that."]],[364,["Immediately."]],[365,["Next day they were different people."]],[368,["But how to prove, how to tell, was a problem."]],[375,["They improved so much, unbelievable."]],[379,["And I felt very close to them that they are","the people who have achieved it in such a"]],[385,["short time."]],[386,["For which, I think otherwise I have to work","very hard for others."]],[391,["They became hippies because of some sort of","a fashion maybe?"]],[398,["But English don’t take to fashions so much."]],[400,["I don’t know why."]],[402,["Why they had become hippies, and they were","very well educated, all were professors, this,"]],[409,["that."]],[410,["And they said that we have taken to this hippiedom","because we wanted to experiment as to what"]],[417,["it is."]],[419,["I said “You can’t experiment with a snake,","that ‘let the snake bite us and then we’ll"]],[427,["experiment.’"]],[428,["Once it bites you, you are finished.”"]],[433,["All these things have been always, kept Me","attached to London and I have been here for"]],[442,["twenty years continuously."]],[446,["But the work that we did, I don’t know why","it did not reach intellectuals, and newspaper"]],[454,["people, while all other stupid people who","came here were so much enamored, and were"]],[462,["given so much prominence, everybody was talking","about them."]],[472,["So that’s how the London is based about","Sahaja Yoga."]],[478,["It is a spontaneous happening within, a spontaneous."]],[484,["Yesterday you saw, I didn’t do anything,","it just worked spontaneously, because it is"]],[492,["there and it has to be awakened, that’s","all."]],[496,["But I know also people who have been cured,","have been completely cured of very difficult"]],[504,["diseases with Sahaja Yoga."]],[507,["It’s a fact, it’s not just I’m boasting","about it, but it’s a fact."]],[514,["It’s a very powerful thing within us."]],[517,["This power of Kundalini is extremely, extremely","kind, loving, affectionate and effective."]],[527,["As I said it’s your Mother, and when it","acts, it works so well, it works so well."]],[537,["It is impossible to avoid Kundalini awakening","once it has been awakened."]],[548,["But I know some people who have been able","to defy it, maybe because of basically they"]],[556,["were cheats or immoral or some sort of people,","but they were very, very few."]],[564,["Mostly I have seen people have grown to great","heights with Sahaja Yoga."]],[573,["Today I want to tell you a special thing about","Sahaja Yoga."]],[581,["That in Sahaja Yoga, slowly, slowly you’ll","find, most of your problems, most of your,"]],[594,["I should say enemies, as in Sanskrit they","are called shadripus, all these will just"]],[606,["disappear."]],[607,["You’ll be amazed, how they are just disappearing."]],[613,["Jealousy, anger, racism, all kinds of stupid","things that are lingering, of which you may"]],[623,["not be even aware, just drop out."]],[628,["And you feel such love and such affection","for everyone who comes across."]],[636,["You try to give them Sahaja Yoga, you try","to tell them about Sahaja Yoga."]],[641,["They may like it, they may not like it."]],[644,["English are little conservative, so that conservatism","has gone a little bit sometimes, too much."]],[654,["There’s no harm in talking about Sahaja","Yoga."]],[657,["I have seen people who have gurus, of the","worst type, worst type."]],[665,["One lady was sitting next to Me…"]],[668,["It’s quite warm today?"]],[672,["They told Me it’s very cold."]],[677,["That’s England [laughs]."]],[680,["It’s cold or hot."]],[683,["The climate is whimsical, agreed."]],[687,["Very whimsical, if you are going out, say,","we were living in Oxsted, 25 miles away, and"]],[696,["when I started from there it was, surprisingly,","it was absolutely clear sky."]],[704,["And by the time I reached Victoria station,","it was pouring cats and dogs as you say."]],[714,["Horrible, I couldn’t understand."]],[716,["Or vice versa."]],[719,["So the climate is whimsical, but that makes","you prepared for every kind of climate, every"]],[728,["kind of incident."]],[732,["And you understand, that that is what is the","nature."]],[737,["We shouldn’t fight with the nature, but","we shouldn’t expect everything to be absolutely"]],[744,["first class when we are going out."]],[748,["So this kind of taking risk has made you people","very courageous, I must say."]],[757,["Courageous."]],[758,["And this courage is to be used now in Sahaja","Yoga."]],[763,["You have to use this for spreading Sahaja","Yoga."]],[767,["This is your mission."]],[769,["This is what you’ll enjoy."]],[770,["You’ll be amazed, the more you spread, the","higher you’ll go."]],[775,["You’ll develop much more, much more powers","within you, and unlimited powers."]],[783,["As far as miracles are concerned, I’m just","- don’t know how to explain them."]],[792,["Such miracles take place."]],[794,["We had a lady from America, she was staying","with us and she had some sort of a funny disease,"]],[804,["that all her intestines and stomach were all","entangled with some sort of a growth."]],[811,["And she had it before also."]],[813,["So she had an operation and they took out","everything."]],[817,["Again she came to Cabella, and she was staying","there."]],[820,["Again she developed the same problems, the","same symptoms."]],[823,["She was quite worried."]],[826,["So they said, “All right, we’ll take you","to the hospital.”"]],[829,["She said, “No, let me first meditate,”","and with meditation, you’ll be amazed, when"]],[836,["she went to the hospital, the doctor said","“There is nothing, you’re absolutely clear."]],[839,["You are cleared out.”"]],[843,["This meditation can help you in so many ways."]],[846,["It’s not a meditation of some sort of a","chanting, or some sort of a going into, as"]],[856,["they said you’ll fly in the air or all those","things, no."]],[861,["It just is meditation by which you enter within","yourself."]],[867,["Your Kundalini works out with this meditation."]],[870,["She looks after your illness, she looks after","about your curing."]],[875,["All kinds of things she looks after."]],[878,["Even the traffic you know, you’ll be surprised,","it works in so many ways."]],[884,["It is so miraculous, you will find all the","time as if you are helped by some people,"]],[893,["some angels are there who are helping you."]],[896,["You’ll be amazed at yourself, when it starts","working out."]],[900,["So, instead of doubting, you keep watching","what’s happening, how it works out."]],[907,["So many things work out in such a beautiful","manner, that you are amazed, as if you have"]],[913,["entered into the kingdom of God."]],[915,["Which you have."]],[917,["All the possible help, all the possible solutions,","just come like that."]],[925,["I’ve seen one fellow who had some case on","him, and he told Me, “Mother, I have this"]],[932,["case, and this and that.”"]],[935,["I said, “All right, you meditate,” and","when he went to the court, they said that"]],[939,["you’re already solved, that thing is solved","already."]],[942,["He was amazed, “How is it solved?"]],[946,["I never even went to the court.”"]],[950,["Then he went to the lawyer, and the lawyer","said, “Yes, they have solved, but I don’t"]],[956,["know how, because I didn’t go to the court."]],[959,["I was sitting with Mataji, I didn’t go to","the court."]],[963,["But your problem is solved, because when I","went to the court next day, they said it’s"]],[969,["all done.”"]],[970,["“But who was arguing the case?”"]],[973,["“They said you.”"]],[974,["“I?"]],[975,["I was not arguing, so who was arguing the","case?”"]],[979,["“There was, and even you see, the remark","of the magistrate is this, that you argued"]],[986,["very well.”"]],[987,["It’s a fact, I’m not telling you stories,","it’s a fact, it happened."]],[993,["He said, “Mother, did you go to argue the","case?”"]],[997,["I said, “I am very bad at that, I do not","know how to argue.”"]],[1010,["But such wonderful things have happened, I","mean, you won’t believe, unbelievable things"]],[1015,["happen."]],[1016,["And, it is just to be seen."]],[1019,["As I told you yesterday, you have to be in","the witness state."]],[1024,["Don’t you think that there’s anything","less or more with anybody."]],[1031,["You are all there and are looked after."]],[1034,["But have faith in yourself is the main point."]],[1036,["If you don’t have faith in yourself, it","doesn’t work."]],[1040,["Just have faith in yourself."]],[1041,["I’m not telling you just tall stories, I","tell you."]],[1044,["It is the fact, I Myself I’m amazed how","things work out."]],[1051,["I’ll tell you about Dr Spiro, one day what","happened, interesting."]],[1056,["You see, I had told the boys not to go in","the sun - in Indian sun, you know?- after"]],[1064,["10 o’clock."]],[1066,["But they wanted, I don’t know, to burn their","skin or whatever they wanted to do."]],[1072,["Five, six boys were there, and when they came","away, they had all blisters all over in their"]],[1082,["hands."]],[1083,["So he said, they have to be given tetanus,","that has to be done and all that."]],[1091,["I said, “Don’t worry, it can be solved.”"]],[1092,["I just took some water and a little cotton","wool and put it on them."]],[1106,["And I was, as I was taking it down, it all","disappeared, it was all disappearing."]],[1112,["But I told them, that in the evening, go and","sit in the sea so your heat is taken out."]],[1119,["I think they didn’t do it."]],[1120,["I sent them My saris to cover themselves."]],[1124,["I said, “Take these saris, cover yourselves,","sleep with them.”"]],[1130,["After that, I went to My brother’s place","in Aurangabad."]],[1134,["He was the judge of the high court there."]],[1138,["I went there and My brother came and he said,","“What has happened to Your saris?”"]],[1146,["I said, “Why?”"]],[1147,["“See how many big, big holes there are.”"]],[1151,["And I said “How do you know?”"]],[1152,["He said, “These girls went to take out Your","sari for Your bath and there are big, big"]],[1156,["holes all over.”"]],[1157,["All the saris had those holes."]],[1159,["So he said, “How will You manage?”"]],[1162,["I said, “I’ll manage with one sari, it","doesn’t matter.”"]],[1166,["But, I just remember these boys, the amount","of heat they had."]],[1170,["They burnt the saris so badly."]],[1172,["But they were not aware of their heat, that","was inside."]],[1176,["Though they were cured, the heat was inside."]],[1179,["Like this, there are many, many things that","have happened, and I don’t know how to explain"]],[1186,["to you all these miracles."]],[1190,["Now, why do these miracles are there?"]],[1198,["Why there is these miraculous photographs?"]],[1200,["You must have seen them."]],[1202,["To convince people."]],[1204,["They were never convinced you see."]],[1207,["Christ came, He crucified Himself."]],[1211,["Nobody was convinced that He was divine."]],[1214,["The problem is, human mind is so stuck up","that they cannot accept anybody as divine."]],[1225,["And at this time, in modern times, when there","are so many false gurus, all kinds of things"]],[1230,["going on, I think it was necessary for them","to produce these miraculous photographs."]],[1239,["Actually, I don’t do anything, to be very","frank, I don’t do."]],[1243,["It’s all done by this all-pervading Power."]],[1247,["I was once in Brisbane in Australia and I","was sleeping, daytime, so one girl saw a beautiful"]],[1259,["rainbow and she wanted to take a picture."]],[1264,["She took a picture of the rainbow, but can","you imagine a painting I love very much of"]],[1271,["Raphael, of the Mother and the Child, I like","it very much."]],[1276,["And she sees that thing on the photograph."]],[1280,["And the circular light that Raphaello has","shown was on top of Her head."]],[1290,["I thought Raphaello himself has painted or","what has happened?"]],[1294,["I couldn’t believe Myself."]],[1296,["Like this, so many things, so many things,","you can see one by one, some are they have"]],[1303,["collected, some are not."]],[1305,["Recently we had a program in Bombay where","we get at least 2 lakhs of people, that means"]],[1313,["200 000 people and they were all preparing,","arranging the stage, and in the photograph,"]],[1327,["I’m already there."]],[1330,["And with Me is Ganesha sitting."]],[1332,["Even Shri Ganesha’s actual body, actual","face was there in one of the other pictures."]],[1339,["I myself start wondering what is all going","on."]],[1344,["This is the work of Paramachaitanya, which","is trying to convince people who cannot be"]],[1350,["easily convinced."]],[1351,["It’s trying to make people understand that","this is divine, this is Divinity."]],[1358,["They never believed in Christ, they never","believed in anyone."]],[1362,["All kinds of things they have said about Christ,","all sorts of things they have tried to talk"]],[1369,["about Krishna, Rama."]],[1370,["But, still there are very few people who really","believe in them."]],[1374,["They think it’s a myth."]],[1378,["But all these myths become real."]],[1382,["You’ll be amazed how you will change."]],[1390,["You’ll start looking so much younger first","of all."]],[1396,["Myself, you know, I’m very good at recognizing","people, but some people I could not recognize."]],[1401,["I said “Are you the same?”"]],[1404,["“Yes.”"]],[1405,["So transformed, the whole face changes, looking","so much different."]],[1410,["One fellow was bald, he’s got all the hair","on his head."]],[1416,["And what did he do?"]],[1417,["He said, “No, Mother, I just raised my Kundalini,","that’s all.”"]],[1421,["“You didn’t do anything?”"]],[1422,["“No, no, I didn’t do anything.”"]],[1424,["And he had become so bald, so much bald headed,","that in the passport, his photograph was there,"]],[1431,["and when the passport fellow saw him he said,","“You?”"]],[1437,["Because he was bald-headed at that time, but","he had hair before, but now, his hair has"]],[1444,["come back."]],[1445,["Unbelievable things have happened."]],[1449,["Unbelievable."]],[1451,["And all this is for you."]],[1453,["You’re in for it."]],[1455,["You can have many, many miracles."]],[1459,["My, another name is also Daisy, because My","mother was very fond of a teacher, her name"]],[1469,["was Daisy, apart from this, she gave Me the","name of Daisy."]],[1473,["Now, when I came to England, I found daisies","everywhere, but they had no fragrance, no"]],[1479,["fragrance."]],[1480,["We don’t get daisies in India, you will","be surprised."]],[1485,["But then, they got fragrance."]],[1487,["All daisies got fragrance, very surprising."]],[1490,["They never had fragrance and they started","smelling very well, in a very beautiful manner."]],[1500,["So it works also in the nature somehow."]],[1502,["I mean, that nature should know My name is","Daisy, that this - it’s remarkable."]],[1509,["There’s no end to it."]],[1512,["So many angels and so many divine vibrations","are working it out."]],[1521,["So I have to first tell you that you must","have faith in yourself, very important, and"]],[1526,["you must meditate."]],[1527,["Once you start meditating, you’ll become","masters of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1533,["For this, color is no bar, religion no bar,","race no bar, nothing."]],[1541,["As long as you are a human being and you have","got your realization, you can really go very"]],[1551,["far."]],[1552,["So many miracles have happened to Sahaja Yogis,","so many miracles."]],[1558,["And I was surprised, even when they write","to Me, they say Mother, nobody will believe,"]],[1563,["but this is what has happened to us."]],[1566,["So, I would request you to have faith in yourself","and do meditation."]],[1572,["Very important."]],[1574,["Then the growth within, you’ll be amazed."]],[1578,["I have seen people who never wrote any single","line are great poets."]],[1584,["Those who could not stand on the dais to speak","have become great orators."]],[1590,["So many people have achieved so much."]],[1594,["But I just told them, don’t talk about it,","if you talk about it they’ll think we are"]],[1601,["telling some sort of a story."]],[1602,["It’s a fact."]],[1603,["Now you also find out in your own life, the","experience of all these changes that take"]],[1611,["place."]],[1612,["How the relationships change."]],[1613,["There was one fellow in America, very rich","man, and he told Me, “I don’t know what"]],[1620,["You did to me.”"]],[1621,["I said, “What happened?”"]],[1622,["“See, I hated my cousin, I really hated","him, but the other day I saw him and I felt"]],[1628,["like hugging him."]],[1629,["And I kissed him so he started looking at","me, what’s gone wrong with me?”"]],[1630,["You see, like, you change so enjoy now, you","enjoy the collectivity."]],[1631,["Now in India we have a seminar of Sahaja Yogis."]],[1632,["You see we have people from all over the world."]],[1633,["We have from Brazil, from Argentina, say from","England, also Spain, everywhere."]],[1636,["Russia, such a lot from Russia."]],[1637,["And when they meet, I’ve never heard anybody","quarrelling or hitting or anything."]],[1638,["They are in thousands, last time we had ten","thousand, but I’ve never seen anybody - but"]],[1642,["such understanding and love."]],[1644,["Of course, they pull each other’s legs,","that’s true, as friends, but on the whole"]],[1652,["there’s never a fight, never a quarrel."]],[1657,["Can you imagine if this thing happened to","the whole world?"]],[1661,["All these wars that they have started, all","this kind of problems they have created in"]],[1669,["the name of God, in the name of land, or whatever","it is, will be finished."]],[1677,["This should happen, this should happen to","the whole world, and I want this world to"]],[1684,["be a very happy and a beautiful place."]],[1689,["And I’m sure you all can achieve it."]],[1692,["Because of you, the vibrations will spread."]],[1696,["Vibrations of love, vibrations of compassion."]],[1703,["We have also a great idea of having compassion","for the people who are suffering."]],[1711,["So I’ve started a hospital which is very","successful, and we don’t have to charge"]],[1715,["anything except for what they have to pay","for their food and stay."]],[1720,["And it’s working wonders."]],[1722,["What has happened?"]],[1724,["What has happened, how is it working like","that?"]],[1728,["It is nothing but sheer divine power."]],[1732,["We have another hospital now we are starting","in Delhi, and also destitute women, and it’s"]],[1741,["surprising how things work out."]],[1744,["There was a lady who came and complained about","her husband."]],[1747,["That he has been very unkind to her and this","and that."]],[1751,["I said “All right, once we have destitute","women’s home you come there.”"]],[1756,["Amazing, the husband came next day and she","tells Me, “Mother, he’s became a very"]],[1762,["nice man now."]],[1763,["He’s become very nice.”"]],[1766,["“Really?”"]],[1767,["He didn’t come to meditation, he didn’t","get his realization, how has he become so"]],[1775,["nice?"]],[1776,["How suddenly he has become so nice to his","wife?"]],[1778,["It’s really unbelievable how it acts."]],[1783,["I tell you, we don’t know, this all-pervading","power is the power of love."]],[1786,["God is Truth, but Truth is Love."]],[1793,["Love not biased, love not because there is","some sort of a gain or some relationship,"]],[1801,["but love which is just love."]],[1804,["The ocean of love, and you’ll just start","enjoying that ocean."]],[1809,["I have seen it Myself happening and you also","should see."]],[1814,["Whenever is possible please come to Cabella","at least, is in Italy."]],[1819,["There you can see."]],[1821,["And we have nothing but a hangar, and they","didn’t want Me to build anything for them."]],[1827,["I said in the hangar how do you live?"]],[1832,["“That’s the best Mother, we want to live","in the camp."]],[1839,["We don’t want to live in rooms."]],[1845,["We have had enough of it.”"]],[1847,["Imagine, Russians, Americans, all of them","in such beautiful enjoyment."]],[1851,["I tell you, we have to enjoy life."]],[1854,["God has not created us to weep and cry, but","to enjoy."]],[1858,["It’s good for you, it’s good for your","children, good for your family, good for your"]],[1865,["nation and for the whole world."]],[1868,["As I told you that you are important because","from England everything circulates, circulates,"]],[1876,["circulates."]],[1877,["So, how important you are in Sahaja Yoga I’m","just trying to tell you."]],[1883,["Very important and you can do a lot."]],[1887,["One person went to Russia and now we have","thousands of Russian Sahaja Yogis."]],[1892,["Thousands of them, they are so dedicated,","so beautiful, you can’t imagine."]],[1901,["Once I was in Moscow when this coup took place","and big problem was there."]],[1910,["So I asked the Sahaja Yogis, “Aren’t you","worried about this coup that has taken place?”"]],[1916,["“Which coup, Mother?”"]],[1917,["I said, “Which you had in Moscow.“ “Mother,","we don’t live in Moscow, we live in the"]],[1924,["Kingdom of God.”"]],[1925,["Just imagine."]],[1931,["So when you face reality you are enamored,","you are just filled with joy, because reality"]],[1940,["is joy."]],[1941,["Today’s function, I have never attended","before like this."]],[1945,["But they said “Mother, You should come”","so I’ve tried to make it, but I would like"]],[1951,["you to ask Me questions now."]],[1953,["It’s very important, if you have any doubts,","please ask, or if you have anything to say,"]],[1957,["please ask."]],[1959,["Thank you."]],[1961,["No questions?"]],[1962,["Q. Shri Mataji, what do you think of Buddhism?"]],[1966,["A. Now see, Buddhism is very different from","Buddha."]],[1971,["Absolutely."]],[1972,["Buddha first got his realization."]],[1977,["First he became a Buddha and then he started","Buddha religion."]],[1982,["But the way people are doing Buddhism is the","other way round."]],[1986,["That you give up your wife, you give up your","children, you give up even your dress, everything."]],[1994,["To whom? To these people."]],[1998,["Buddha started after his realization."]],[2002,["After your realization only you can become","Buddha, means a realized soul."]],[2011,["And he said it the same way."]],[2014,["He said Buddham Sharanam Gachami, I surrender","myself to other realized souls, Buddham Sharanam"]],[2024,["Gachami."]],[2025,["Then he said Sangham Sharanam Gachami, Dharmam","Sharanam Gachami, I surrender myself to the"]],[2033,["religion which is within me, innate religion."]],[2039,["And thirdly he says, Sangham Sharanam Gachami,","I surrender myself to the collective."]],[2053,["This nonsense of giving up this, giving up","that, I mean, it’s too much."]],[2062,["If you are holding onto something then you","can give up."]],[2066,["If you are not holding onto anything then","what are you going to give up?"]],[2073,["Simple thing like that, for example, in Canada,","one fellow came wearing that Buddhist’s"]],[2074,["dress."]],[2075,["I don’t like it."]],[2078,["A Sahaja Yogi said “You’d better go and","change, Mother will not give you realization"]],[2087,["if you are wearing this dress.”"]],[2092,["So he came to Me and, “Mother, please forgive","me, I have no other dress left.”"]],[2098,["I said, “Why?”"]],[2099,["“I have lost everything.”"]],[2100,["He was a big business man."]],[2101,["“I’ve lost everything, I’ve given away","to the Buddhists and I’m left with two pair"]],[2107,["of these clothes and if you don’t give me","realization, what will I do?”"]],[2117,["“Really?”"]],[2118,["“Yes.”"]],[2119,["So, what is there to give up is the point,","what is there to give up?"]],[2122,["If you are not holding onto anything what","are you going to give up?"]],[2125,["Simple thing like that."]],[2127,["Buddha never gave up his clothes, nothing","of the kind."]],[2133,["But he wanted to find out, what is the truth."]],[2136,["So he went round, I mean he tried his level","best and everything, ultimately his Kundalini"]],[2142,["rose and he got the realization."]],[2146,["But what he was doing there, he was just lying","down under a banyan tree."]],[2152,["Now, whatever mistakes he has committed, we","need not do, that you give up your wife, you"]],[2158,["give up your child, give up this, give up","that."]],[2160,["Just the","contrast of what really Buddha achieved, is"]],[2168,["the contrast of that."]],[2174,["So Buddhism is not Buddha by any chance."]],[2189,["Q. The gentleman wants to know what happens","after we die, Mother?"]],[2197,["A. Now, that’s another point."]],[2200,["Everybody worried about what will happen if","we die."]],[2205,["I would say that, as a Sahaja Yogi, you should","not worry about the future because it doesn’t"]],[2212,["exist."]],[2213,["You shouldn’t worry about your past because","it’s finished."]],[2216,["You should be in the presence which is the","reality."]],[2220,["Present is the reality."]],[2221,["What’s the use if I tell you what will happen,","you’ll become a bird or anything, are you"]],[2227,["going to believe Me?"]],[2230,["You shouldn’t."]],[2235,["Q. Could you tell us about angels Shri Mataji?"]],[2251,["A. They are very beautiful, just like flowers,","very fragrant."]],[2263,["And they will help you; you’ll be amazed","how they’ll help you."]],[2271,["You won’t see them, you don’t see them."]],[2275,["But they are there, in the form of some human","being - in so many ways."]],[2288,["So you cannot describe them because you can’t","see them."]],[2293,["But you’ll see their help, and you’ll","be amazed how they guide you to the right"]],[2302,["path."]],[2303,["Now, supposing you lose your way somewhere,","don’t get frustrated, don’t get upset"]],[2308,["about it."]],[2309,["If you have lost your way it must be some","purpose."]],[2314,["On that way when you go you’ll find somebody","whom you have been looking for ages, or maybe"]],[2320,["some sort of a thing you’ll find, some treasure","you’ll find."]],[2322,["So, if you have lost your way, there’s nothing","to worry."]],[2327,["They work very smoothly and sweetly."]],[2333,["Q. She’s asking how you begin to meditate,","Shri Mataji."]],[2349,["A. That of course they will tell you."]],[2353,["There’s a photograph of Mine, first you","have to work on that."]],[2359,["Afterwards you will know that how it works,","but first you have to use My photograph, I"]],[2365,["don’t know what to do because the photograph","has the vibrations."]],[2368,["You can test it, you’ll get tremendous vibrations","from the photograph."]],[2375,["It’s a kind, as we can call, a figure, which","emits vibrations."]],[2381,["I do not gain anything by that, but you will","gain."]],[2384,["You will gain, so you have to sit down and","meditate before the photograph."]],[2390,["It’s full of vibrations."]],[2394,["It’s so effective I tell you, that when","you put these photographs of Mine all over"]],[2403,["London, it works."]],[2412,["Q. Is prayer the same as meditation?"]],[2425,["A. See, before you are connected to the Divine,","what is your prayer?"]],[2432,["It’s nothing."]],[2434,["If you telephone without the connection, what","is it?"]],[2439,["So after realization, the prayer very much","helps."]],[2443,["But meditation is inner, prayer is outside."]],[2452,["For your inner growth, meditation is necessary."]],[2455,["You don’t have to spend too much time, say","about in the evening before sleeping, if you"]],[2462,["can do it for about say ten minutes, or maybe","five minutes in the morning, that’s very"]],[2474,["good."]],[2476,["Q. Sahaja Yoga is available to everybody,","is it even available to politicians, Mother?"]],[2498,["A. I mean, you know, you’ll be surprised,","in India so many politicians have come to"]],[2512,["Sahaja Yoga."]],[2513,["In India."]],[2514,["But I don’t know about English politicians."]],[2518,["I have met some, but they are so much involved","into their own positions and things."]],[2529,["So far none of them, but if you can grab some","people it’s a good idea."]],[2543,["Q. The gentleman asks for your personal blessing","Shri Mataji, he wants your personal blessing."]],[2562,["A. May God bless you, may God bless you."]],[2568,["It is for everyone."]],[2572,["It’s for everyone."]],[2576,["Q. What is the difference between the soul","and the spirit."]],[2583,["A."]],[2584,["The soul and the spirit?"]],[2587,["It’s a subject should be dealt later on","but little in short I’ll tell you."]],[2594,["The soul is the essence, essence of the five","elements."]],[2604,["Essence."]],[2605,["For example, for Mother Earth, the essence","is fragrance, so all these five elements have"]],[2618,["essence, and this essence contains the soul","in the sense that the soul is the reflection"]],[2625,["of God Almighty within us."]],[2629,["So the body is that of the five elements,","the essence of the five elements and the spirit"]],[2640,["is the one which is reflected on it, that","is the reflection of God Almighty."]],[2657,["But later on you’ll know much more."]],[2669,["Q. Mother he wants to know if You still meditate","Yourself?"]],[2680,["A. I am in meditation all the time."]],[2682,["(A gentleman starts to speak for a very long","time, Shri Mataji says “It’s a big lecture.”)"]],[2733,["Q. He wants to know, there are different meditations","he says, and he’s confused, Mother."]],[2763,["A. Meditation cannot be different, it has","to be one, and the one that makes you deep"]],[2779,["is the meditation."]],[2783,["All kinds of meditation, there was one meditation","they had started here by which you will start"]],[2790,["moving three feet higher than normal."]],[2794,["Now think of it, already we have traffic jams."]],[2801,["You can find the stupidity in all of them."]],[2809,["If you use your intelligence, you’ll find","out, because you don’t grow."]],[2815,["Meditation that is good is the one by which","you grow."]],[2820,["Everything is not the food."]],[2824,["The food that you can eat is the food."]],[2841,["Q. What do you think about Islam Mother?"]],[2851,["A. Islam is great, no doubt."]],[2856,["But nobody follows Islam."]],[2858,["Nobody follows, nobody has read even Koran."]],[2860,["You’ll be amazed."]],[2861,["They are fighting without understanding what","Islam has written."]],[2866,["Mohammed Sahib was one of the incarnations","of the real Gurus, but Muslims, stupid as"]],[2875,["they are, they don’t follow."]],[2877,["They don’t follow the exact sayings of Koran."]],[2880,["Now in Koran is written, that at the time","of resurrection your hands will speak."]],[2890,["See?"]],[2891,["And without that you cannot be Muslim, I mean","Muslim means surrendered."]],[2896,["Just imagine, it’s all Sahaja Yoga, if you","can read between the lines."]],[2902,["We have a book called as “Koran Enlightened,”","we have also “Bible Enlightened,” we have"]],[2917,["“Gita Enlightened.”"]],[2923,["All right?"]],[2930,["Q. He says he finds it difficult to meditate","because his mind is wandering."]],[2951,["How to control the mind Mother?"]],[2955,["A. Never control."]],[2956,["Don’t try to control it."]],[2962,["There’s no need to control."]],[2964,["Your Kundalini itself will give you thoughtless","awareness, She’ll work it out."]],[2972,["Try on the photograph, it will work out."]],[2984,["Q. It’s a request Mother, will you come","to Ireland one day?"]],[3000,["A. Oh, of course!"]],[3006,["They are lost, fighting among themselves."]],[3015,["But I have a special feeling for Ireland."]],[3017,["Because of ignorance, complete ignorance,","now the Catholics were fighting Protestants,"]],[3023,["now Protestants are fighting each other, now","Catholics will start fighting each other."]],[3031,["I don’t want to say anything, but you must","understand that all these religions have created"]],[3040,["nothing but fighting mongerers."]],[3047,["Crucified Christ and how can you think of","fighting?"]],[3051,["All over the world there’s fight in the","name of God."]],[3056,["Can you imagine the stupidity?"]],[3062,["Irish are very nice people, very simple, but","they get lost into these different, different"]],[3077,["ideas."]],[3078,["Actually, religion should never make you fight,","but the religions have misled them, the religions"]],[3089,["have misled them, all right?"]],[3092,["We have to give them that real religion of","within."]],[3097,["Innate religion."]],[3098,["In Italy they started an argument with Me","and they said, “We don’t” - ultimately,"]],[3110,["they said, “We don’t want to have one","religion for the whole world.”"]],[3114,["I said, “Why?"]],[3115,["Because then you can’t fight, isn’t it?”"]],[3119,["You want to have many religions so you can","nicely fight with each other."]],[3125,["Like Rwanda and all these people."]],[3131,["Religion must bring peace, joy, otherwise","what’s the use of having any religion?"]],[3137,["Q. Will you one day come to Scotland, Mother?"]],[3146,["A. Scotland I have been."]],[3150,["I have been to Scotland, but, the problem","was, at about 12 o’clock everybody was drunk."]],[3184,["Q. Can Sahaja Yoga change your fate, change","your karma, change your destiny?"]],[3203,["Can Sahaja Yoga change it?"]],[3205,["A. Your karmas are finished."]],[3208,["After Sahaja Yoga, your karmas are finished."]],[3211,["And can change your face also, but why do","you want to change your face?"]],[3219,["- Fate, fate!!"]],[3221,["I thought she wanted to change…."]],[3229,["Ah, of course, of course it can."]],[3233,["It can change your fate and all your aspirations","are changed."]],[3245,["Then you just want to spread Sahaja Yoga,","and enjoy the company of Sahaja Yogis."]],[3258,["Q. He is a student Mother, how can Sahaja","Yoga help with being a student, with education?"]],[3274,["A. Very much."]],[3275,["For student, it’s a blessing I say."]],[3279,["Do you know, Sahaja Yogis who have been very","bad students, have stood first, have got first"]],[3285,["class, first all over the world Sahaja Yogis","are doing so well in their studies because"]],[3293,["you get a clear cut vision."]],[3295,["It’s tremendous, for students it’s very","good."]],[3296,["Q. Is it important to be a vegetarian Mother?"]],[3303,["A. Not at all."]],[3313,["You see, in Sahaja Yoga we don’t eat animals","which are bigger than us and you need not"]],[3322,["eat animals in case you are a person who requires","more vegetables."]],[3328,["So it depends on your constitution."]],[3332,["Now supposing a person who is vegetarian and","gets diarrhea, he should stop."]],[3339,["I’m not a vegetarian."]],[3354,["Q. He’s got a problem with his knees."]],[3372,["A. Can be cured."]],[3375,["Knee problems can be cured."]],[3376,["And how and when, that’s what, you have","to see these people and they will tell you"]],[3383,["how to cure it."]],[3386,["It can be cured."]],[3389,["It is related to your chakras."]],[3405,["Q. She says You travel a lot, do You fall","sick?"]],[3425,["You travel all over the world, to different","climates, do You fall sick?"]],[3431,["A. No, no."]],[3433,["You see, people while they are traveling,","they think they are traveling, that’s why"]],[3438,["they get sick."]],[3439,["I never think."]],[3441,["I think I’m sitting nicely on a coach and","also they think that, when will they reach,"]],[3459,["will there be people or not, worried about","that, or maybe their past things they are"]],[3477,["worried."]],[3480,["I am not."]],[3483,["I don’t get sick."]],[3485,["Q. Another request, Shri Mataji, when will","you go to South Africa?"]],[3492,["A."]],[3493,["You know the problem was like this, that on","My passport it was written that Indians cannot."]],[3499,["Because I am a diplomat, diplomatic thing,","we cannot go to South Africa."]],[3504,["Now they have removed, so after that I will","try to."]],[3513,["Q. He says, Shri Mataji, that he lives in","South Africa and You are very far away physically,"]],[3526,["but he feels that You are there, helping him,","why is that?"]],[3531,["A. That’s My attention."]],[3534,["I really want to go to South Africa."]],[3536,["I’ve been trying, but I haven’t got the","permission."]],[3542,["And now I’ve got the permission, definitely","I’ll go."]],[3544,["And when you don’t have permission you are","more concerned about that country, isn’t"]],[3554,["it?"]],[3557,["Q. What do you think about entities, bad spirits","Mother, earth-bound spirits?"]],[3566,["A. They are, no doubt."]],[3570,["They are there."]],[3571,["But you don’t worry, you don’t have them."]],[3578,["Q. Is there any similarity that we know of","between Sahaja Yoga and ancient Egyptian or"]],[3608,["African religions?"]],[3609,["A."]],[3610,["In Africa, I was surprised that they have","talked about Kundalini."]],[3614,["They have, and I have seen some of the maps,","old maps, of Africa, they have made the picture"]],[3625,["of Kundalini also, all over."]],[3629,["Even in a place like Bolivia, which is so","far away, and somebody went to Bolivia from"]],[3637,["Italy and he said, “Mother they know everything","about Kundalini.”"]],[3641,["I said, “Really?”"]],[3642,["“Yes, they know, but they don’t know how","to awaken it.”"]],[3647,["And Sahaja Yoga has spread so much in Bolivia,","the Minister from there came to see Me."]],[3656,["And who told them?"]],[3657,["I said, “Who told you?”"]],[3658,["They said, “There were two saints who came","from India.”"]],[3662,["Even in Ukraine, I was surprised, they said,","“There were two saints who came here from"]],[3669,["India, they told us about Kundalini.”"]],[3671,["Chinese people, they believe that there is","a treasure of spirituality in India but they"]],[3678,["don’t know what it is, you see."]],[3681,["But these two I don’t know who they were."]],[3686,["Two saints known as Machindranath and Goraknath","who have been traveling all over the world."]],[3688,["I don’t know if they went all the way over","there."]],[3697,["Q. A question about Paramahansa Yogananda,","he’s quite famous here because of his book."]],[3708,["A. He’s famous?"]],[3709,["What has he done?"]],[3711,["What has he done?"]],[3714,["Writing a funny book like that, that’s all."]],[3717,["I don’t want to discuss, but first when","you ask about somebody, you’ll have to tell"]],[3723,["Me what he has done."]],[3726,["Q. The gentleman set up a “Self Realization","Fellowship” in America."]],[3739,["A. I know many in America who have done it,","and they are more difficult to get Self-realization."]],[3749,["There’s a big organization there, and they","all believe they are Self-realized, but they"]],[3755,["don’t know any vibrations, they can’t","feel anything, and when they have been to"]],[3760,["that organization, I find it difficult to","give them realization."]],[3767,["In the name of God, in the name of Self-realization","if you spoil the Kundalini of people, I don’t"]],[3773,["know what to say about them."]],[3784,["Q. Is it possible to meditate for the benefit","of other people?"]],[3810,["A."]],[3812,["In meditation you don’t think of anything."]],[3815,["See, you have to become thoughtless, that","is meditation."]],[3820,["And for other people, you can always ask,","you are yourself protected, and there are"]],[3826,["ways they’ll tell you how to work out for","others."]],[3834,["See, they’ll tell you later on."]],[3838,["Q. Shri Mataji, will peace, complete peace,","ever exist on the planet?"]],[3848,["A. I wish that, I very much wish that, but","it depends on you people."]],[3854,["How much you work it out."]],[3855,["Q. He wants to know if there is any connection","between the work that You do and the work"]],[3893,["that Sai Baba does?"]],[3896,["A. Which Sai Baba?"]],[3900,["Q."]],[3901,["This modern fellow, Mother."]],[3905,["A. Well."]],[3907,["I mean, giving diamonds and this and that."]],[3912,["Shirdi Sai Nath is correct, Shirdi Sai Nath","of course, but not this one."]],[3921,["People who want diamonds can go to him, baba","I can’t give diamonds."]],[3927,["Q. Are there more people becoming Self-realized,","or less people?"]],[3940,["A. Much more."]],[3942,["It’s increasing, much more."]],[3947,["I told you I started with one lady and in","England with seven, now look at them."]],[3958,["Q. If someone develops astral projection,","by accident Mother, and they feel bad, what"]],[3968,["can they do?"]],[3970,["A. They will get rid of it if they become","realized people, because you’re protected."]],[3976,["It’s very dangerous to have that astral","nonsense."]],[3979,["Q. The gentleman is interested in Your experience","with Mahatma Gandhi?"]],[3980,["A. Mahatma Gandhi was My disciple."]],[3981,["You’ll be amazed."]],[3982,["And he told Me, let our country become free,","and in that freedom then you can start your"]],[3985,["Sahaja Yoga."]],[3986,["Then we had Lal Bahadur Shastri, who understood","Me and he said, of course, let me come back"]],[3992,["from Pakistan, he had gone to Russia for Pakistan","problem."]],[4000,["He never came back."]],[4009,["Q. He said yesterday Shri Mataji, You said","you may feel cool under the hands, he wants"]],[4026,["to know why, what it is?"]],[4028,["A. It is, you should take it up you see, it","has some reasons, but I don’t want to tell"]],[4050,["that."]],[4052,["You just take it up there like that."]],[4065,["Q. What do You think about healing?"]],[4068,["There are all different kinds of healing,","what do You think about the healing?"]],[4072,["A. Healing should be done with full understanding","of Kundalini."]],[4077,["Any other healing can result into something","else."]],[4082,["So be careful."]],[4089,["Q. Is it true that with Sahaja Yoga your immune","system improves so that you protect yourself"]],[4108,["against disease?"]],[4109,["A. Of course."]],[4111,["Immune system absolutely gets cured, no doubt,","and many problems of immune system also get"]],[4117,["cured."]],[4118,["But also, you are protected."]],[4119,["Q. Another request Shri Mataji, when will","You come to Malaysia?"]],[4131,["A. I have been, I have been many a time."]],[4136,["I have been there, and the Chinese are coming","to Sahaja Yoga, but Indians, I don’t know"]],[4146,["what to say about them."]],[4149,["Q. He’s asking Shri Mataji if you will guide","us into a meditation now?"]],[4155,["There are some people here who were not at","the Royal Albert Hall, Mother."]],[4163,["A. I see."]],[4164,["But are there any questions left?"]],[4166,["Q. He said he has read in a book that it can","be dangerous to awaken to Kundalini, so do"]],[4186,["you need a teacher, Mother?"]],[4187,["A. That’s very true, there have been people","who wrote like this."]],[4191,["But those who wrote, just go and see their","lives, what they have been up to."]],[4196,["You see, you have to be a master, otherwise","you can’t do it."]],[4199,["Then it’s not the Kundalini, but a Deity","there, which gets annoyed, and then it happens."]],[4205,["It’s not Kundalini."]],[4211,["Q. What do you think of Ayurveda?"]],[4219,["A. Quite good."]],[4221,["Ayurveda is quite good, because it deals with","the three doshas and it’s very near Sahaja"]],[4231,["Yoga."]],[4232,["But with Sahaja Yoga you get cured yourself,","so you don’t need anything much."]],[4237,["Q. He says he’s impressed by the fact that","Sahaja Yoga is free, but he thinks it sounds"]],[4266,["too easy, he doesn’t feel that he’s completely","Self-realized, Mother?"]],[4271,["He says he feels the cool breeze, but he thinks","there must be more work to do?"]],[4281,["A. Yes, that’s true but I must say, but","are you an Italian?"]],[4290,["Are you an Italian?"]],[4292,["Irish."]],[4293,["Because the way he was speaking I thought","he was Italian you see."]],[4302,["I went to Italy and I didn’t know, we were","told not to use our hands, and in Italy you"]],[4309,["see, they will go on like this, like that."]],[4311,["And they say something, you don’t know what","they are saying, but their hands are moving"]],[4315,["in different, different directions."]],[4316,["So I thought he was Italian."]],[4318,["All right, what was his question?"]],[4320,["He says it sounds too easy, he thinks there","must be more work to do."]],[4332,["It is very easy to get realization, but to","settle with it, you have to do meditation,"]],[4341,["and you’ll find out what’s wrong with","you."]],[4344,["You’ll find out what chakras are catching","on your fingertips, and then try to improve"]],[4349,["that."]],[4351,["Q. Can Sahaja Yoga help with psychiatric problems,","with mental problems?"]],[4374,["A. Of course, of course it can."]],[4382,["Very much it can help."]],[4390,["Q. Do you think that the world is a better","place?"]],[4407,["Are things improving?"]],[4410,["A. They can."]],[4413,["With Sahaja Yoga it will, definitely improve."]],[4419,["If human beings improve, world will improve","also."]],[4428,["Q. Shri Mataji, he is Italian and he is using","his hands!"]],[4448,["A. Yes, they are very expressive you know","[laughs]."]],[4455,["Q. Shri Mataji, his question is, is it possible","to raise your Kundalini when you are a child"]],[4463,["by accident?"]],[4464,["A. No."]],[4466,["There are children who are born realized."]],[4468,["There are children."]],[4469,["And you can raise their Kundalini also, it’s","very much easier to raise the Kundalini of"]],[4474,["children, you can do that."]],[4476,["So, it’s not an accident, it is just, it’s","there, they are born like that."]],[4482,["They are special people, many people who are","married in Sahaja Yoga have got very great"]],[4488,["saints born to them."]],[4492,["I have a great grandson who is another realized","soul, you know."]],[4497,["So when nobody is there, he will sit before","Me and do like this."]],[4503,["(Shri Mataji holds open Her hands) He’s","not even two, but he speaks so much, he can"]],[4511,["count from one to twenty and it’s tremendous."]],[4523,["Now, one thing I’ll say, if you ask one","question it should be sufficient, all right."]],[4537,["Q. Krishnamurti, Shri Mataji?"]],[4544,["A. Loaded with thoughts."]],[4550,["Another are Krishnamurtis, they can’t get","realization so fast I tell you."]],[4557,["So much have put in their brain."]],[4561,["The Kundalini has to cross the brain."]],[4563,["But so much in the limbic area, that’s My","experience."]],[4582,["Q. He’s heard on a tape Shri Mataji that","you said that you are always in dreams, in"]],[4596,["a dream state."]],[4598,["A. No, not at all."]],[4602,["I actually don’t get any dreams."]],[4608,["I might have said it’s My dream to see the","world like this."]],[4613,["It’s become a fashion now to say that, isn’t","it?"]],[4616,["“It’s My dream.”"]],[4618,["Q. How did you come to this Realization Shri","Mataji?"]],[4633,["A. I was born like that."]],[4644,["I was born."]],[4651,["Q. Why is there a difference, why are we all","not born Self-realized?"]],[4657,["Why is it so difficult for people?"]],[4660,["A. It depends on your past life."]],[4664,["Your desires, if they are unfulfilled, then","you get a life where you are fulfilled."]],[4677,["Like, I know, I’ll tell you one thing, I","had a driver who was very royal by temperament,"]],[4682,["and he was a royal king you see."]],[4684,["But he had to work very hard, so he was desiring","he should become like his chariot driver so"]],[4692,["that he’ll have some rest."]],[4694,["So he became a driver."]],[4697,["Also marriage, and all these things are responsible,","because we should not have any earnest desire,"]],[4704,["then it acts."]],[4707,["Q. In order to get Self-realization, do you","have to desire it Mother?"]],[4732,["A. Of course."]],[4739,["I cannot force."]],[4742,["I cannot force."]],[4745,["Q. Another question Shri Mataji."]],[4751,["What do you think about Chinmoy?"]],[4753,["A. Ah."]],[4754,["You see, if you ask such questions I don’t","know how to answer because it’s very embarrassing."]],[4766,["What has he done?"]],[4768,["That’s the only question you should ask."]],[4772,["And moreover, if you have been to all these","it will be difficult for you to get your Self-realization."]],[4785,["Q. Shri Mataji, is it possible that the Kundalini","can be damaged?"]],[4814,["And what happens if the Kundalini is damaged","already?"]],[4822,["A. I don’t know."]],[4824,["So far, I have seen that so many of these","false gurus and false people have damaged"]],[4830,["the Kundalini of people."]],[4831,["And I have seen their Kundalini has been like","a snake, you would say, hurt."]],[4846,["Difficult, but you can mend it."]],[4849,["If the desire is great, you can mend it."]],[4853,["But I’ve seen that, in some people, the","Kundalini is very much injured."]],[4862,["Q. Do you have to believe in God Mother?"]],[4873,["A. Not necessarily."]],[4877,["Whether you believe or not, He is there."]],[4886,["Q. Mother, one of Your names is Moksha Pradayini,","what is Moksha, what does it mean?"]],[4913,["A. All these names I’ll explain to you later","on, just now they’ll be all shocked with"]],[4916,["this."]],[4917,["It means the giver of Self-realization."]],[4923,["Q. She’s worried about the subconscious."]],[4932,["If we are trying to get into balance, how","can we ignore the subconscious?"]],[4970,["A. It settles down by itself."]],[4976,["You see, the idea of subconscious is not like","Jung."]],[4984,["Subconscious is on the left hand side."]],[4991,["And supraconscious right side."]],[4992,["The Kundalini is in the center."]],[4994,["So you don’t have to worry about subconscious","part, it just disappears."]],[5003,["Q. Is it wrong to have desires for other things,","apart from self-realization?"]],[5022,["A. No, there’s nothing wrong or right."]],[5028,["You don’t have, you don’t have any desire."]],[5031,["You just become so sweet."]],[5035,["You don’t have any desires as such."]],[5039,["Wrong and right is not there, it’s just","you don’t have."]],[5040,["I would say, I have one desire, to now stop","questioning."]],[5046,["It is now about 10 o’clock, and we should","have our, again, the experience of the Self."]],[5069,["So you sit comfortably with your hands towards","Me like that."]],[5074,["And no more questioning, allow your mind to","rest, allow it."]],[5101,["Now put your hands towards Me please."]],[5105,["Now, close your eyes, please close your eyes."]],[5111,["You can raise your left hand on top of your","fontanel bone area, which was the soft bone"]],[5115,["in your childhood."]],[5119,["Just stop thinking, just stop thinking, by","saying “Not this, not this, not this.”"]],[5138,["Now, please raise your right hand, and left","hand towards Me."]],[5164,["Raise your right hand on top of the fontanel","bone area."]],[5190,["Now, please open your eyes and see for yourself","if there’s a cool or a hot breeze coming"]],[5209,["through your fingertips, or on your palm,","or out of your fontanel bone area."]],[5218,["Please, put your both hands towards Me, like","that."]],[5235,["All those who have felt, again cool breeze","out of their palm or out of their fingertips,"]],[5257,["or out of the fontanel bone area."]],[5260,["Or could be hot breeze also, in some people","who have not forgiven themselves and others."]],[5271,["Please raise your hands, those who have."]],[5287,["Ah."]],[5290,["That’s great."]],[5294,["Everyone of you, may God bless you."]],[5317,["I bow to you."]],[5333,["I bow to you."]],[5336,["It’s tremendous, with all these questions","and all that, still, you have achieved it."]],[5389,["It’s a great achievement."]],[5428,["May God bless you for the future."]],[5544,["Would you like to hear one song?"]],[5661,["(musicians sing Powada)"]],[5711,["Now, enjoy yourselves."]],[5761,["Enjoy."]]]);
